],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025, January to February came in at just 23% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, May to June has published at 69% of normal on the middle. Grid 28353 had its driest year in 1958, at 53%.</p>"}
